      <uighur>qudorγ-a - qudurγan</uighur>
      <cyrillic>худрага</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XUDURΓ-A(N)</transcript>
      <definition>n. Crupper; breeching (harness).</definition>
      <page>980</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠤᠳᠣᠷᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠪᠤᠯᠢᠶᠠᠨ ᠠᠯᠠᠪᠺᠢᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- bulijan alabkiky</transcript>
          <definition> To jump on a horse holding to the crupper.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠤᠳᠣᠷᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠭᠤᠳᠤᠰ ᠨᠠᠮᠨᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- γudus namnaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To shoot backward with a bow from horseback.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
